1) What is Devops
    A Culture that improves the organizations the ability to deliver the applications.

                        or
    Devops is a process of improving your delivery or making your delivery quicker by ensuring 
    proper automation , Quality , Monitoring and continous testing.
      1. iMPROVING DELIVERY
      2. Automation
      3. Quality
      4. Moniotring 
      5. Testing
  
2) Why Devops
    Devops is imp bec it helps in faster and reliabe delivery of app by improving collaboration btw 
    development and operations teams. In traditional models, there was a gap btw development and delpoyement
    which caused delays and issues.
    WIth DevOps, we use automation and CI/CD pipelines to build, test, and deploy applications continously.
    This reduces manual errors, improves code quality and speeds up releases.
    In my understanding, DevOps is not just tools, it is a culture where teams work together and take shared
    responsibility for the entire app lifecycle.

