        In DevOps, SDLC is transformed into a continuous lifecycle where planning, coding, building, testing, deployment, 
        and monitoring happen in an automated and iterative loop for faster and reliable software delivery.
            
            |- -       Building     ->     Developing
            |        (Developer)              Developer -> Git
            |---        Testing     
            |          (QE)          ->     Testing
            |---      Deployment     -> Prod     -> Customer

